  <item>
    <title>27. 四次死刑、四个农民的无罪长征：河北陈国清出租车劫杀迷案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ccc68ee2c8be31551810f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ccc68ee2c8be31551810f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 07:35:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1994 年盛夏，河北承德接连发生两起手段惊人相似的出租车司机劫杀案，偏僻山谷成为夺命之地，整座城市人心惶惶。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在限期破案的压力之下，四名来自同一个村庄、无前科、无劣迹的普通青年 —— 陈国清、何国强、杨士亮、朱彦强，一夜之间仅凭口供被认定为连环杀人嫌犯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>此后八年，四人四次被一审判处死刑，却又三次被河北省高级人民法院以事实不清、证据不足发回重审，上演了惊心动魄的 “刀下留人”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刑讯逼供的指控、矛盾百出的口供、不符合规范的凶器鉴定、铁证如山的不在场证明、指向他人的真凶线索被搁置…… 一切都让这起案件疑点丛生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如今三十年过去了，四人狱中减刑后已全部出狱，可申诉仍在继续。几代法律人接力坚守，成立公益律师团提供法律援助，这起案件不仅是四个人的命运悲剧，更是中国司法从疑罪从轻走向疑罪从无的沉重见证。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 两起出租车凶杀案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 陈国清等四人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 承德中院的四次一审</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> 申诉与疑点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 三十年的法律援助接力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>照片集：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>出狱当天的陈国清</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrmP_Gh_YKftsJom9JeLPhjA6XNN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>陈国清与母亲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlK6QdRFhoKR-EYQeLVqU6QuGEKF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>朱彦强与母亲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp62Ri8oYDtPM3I4wZCwX6qj5z29.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>出狱后回家祭祖的何国强</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNlHSCueO4ai5p6jGkcRbilgAYD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>血迹鉴定记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg3vHTUC85P6HDsa68KspTciaHAc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>河北高院的发还提纲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpItTdxXsvvHiGw_NLakxMPnIHDb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>证据匕首</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNkOj01h9sXnAxZRUidYmbdpbCb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一审判决记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpYgdYk6BhpSNWprWm5xaJYv09i2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>申诉到底的陈国清</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz2WGgakGRLn4I5IUJypXI7jjHc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《南方周末：四次死刑四次刀下留人？》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《财新周刊：陈国清案苦候再审》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《财新：喊冤20余年 河北陈国清案三被告人再次向最高法申诉》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《红星新闻：四次死刑被驳回，服刑25年刑满释放者朱彦强：将继续申诉直到无罪》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《刑辩理想主义：陈国清案：回归与出发 — 尘封29年的声音》</span></p>]]></description>
